{"id":"262cf6e0c0418727","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-universal-theory.md","title":"Universal Theory","display":"df-universal-theory — Universal Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-universal-theory","aliases":["17-df-universal-theory"],"display":"df-universal-theory — Universal Theory","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-free-variable]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-quantifier-free-formula]]","[[17-df-symbols]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification_history":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","source_section":"1.3","source_result":"Exercise 1.3.5; local canonical-variable syntax","source_pages_print":[34],"source_pages_djvu":[50],"source_verification":"universal-sentence definition compared in supplied OCR; canonical-variable syntax checked locally","legacy_label":"17-df-5.2.1b"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-universal-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-universal-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-theory — Universal Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e272cfe8553473c0\" href=\"?note=e272cfe8553473c0\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-free-formula\">17-df-quantifier-free-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification_history","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Exercise 1.3.5; local canonical-variable syntax"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>34</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"universal-sentence definition compared in supplied OCR; canonical-variable syntax checked locally"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-5.2.1b"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 为候选公理集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是固定的一阶语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=v_i\">\\(x_i=v_i\\)</span> 是其固定变量序列（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>）。所有公式集与句子集均在同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 中构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\)</span> (quantifier-free formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e272cfe8553473c0\" href=\"?note=e272cfe8553473c0\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-free-formula\">17-df-quantifier-free-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}\\)</span> (free-variable operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{All}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{All}_L\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a> 定义的全称量词块函数，允许空变量序列。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L,\\operatorname{UniversalTheory}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L,\\operatorname{UniversalTheory}_L\\)</span> (class and predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\n&amp;=\n\\bigl\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{39mm}\\land\n\\sigma=\\operatorname{All}_L(\\langle v_i:i&lt;n\\rangle,\\theta)\n\\bigr]\\bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{UniversalTheory}_L(T)\n&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nT\\subseteq\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\n&amp;=\n\\bigl\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{39mm}\\land\n\\sigma=\\operatorname{All}_L(\\langle v_i:i&lt;n\\rangle,\\theta)\n\\bigr]\\bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{UniversalTheory}_L(T)\n&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nT\\subseteq\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The matrix before universal closure is a formula, not already a sentence.\nPreservation under substructures is a theorem about universal theories and is not\npart of this definition.</p>\n<p>原书允许任意变量名的前束全称句；本地选用固定变量前缀。通过束缚变量的无捕获改名，每个原书全称句都有此处的逻辑等价代表，所以等价公理化的保持性结论不受这个语法选择影响。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-free-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e272cfe8553473c0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-quantifier-free-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbols","status":"resolved","id":"3eb5325f08c84582","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-symbols]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 是固定的一阶语言；$x_i=v_i$ 是其固定变量序列（见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]）。所有公式集与句子集均在同一 $L$ 中构造。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ ($L$-sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-free-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e272cfe8553473c0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QFForm}_L$ (quantifier-free formulas, see [[17-df-quantifier-free-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FreeVar}$ (free-variable operation, see [[17-df-free-variable]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbols","status":"resolved","id":"3eb5325f08c84582","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{All}_L$ 为 [[17-df-symbols]] 定义的全称量词块函数，允许空变量序列。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"x_i=v_i","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QFForm}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{All}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L,\\operatorname{UniversalTheory}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\n&=\n\\bigl\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{39mm}\\land\n\\sigma=\\operatorname{All}_L(\\langle v_i:i<n\\rangle,\\theta)\n\\bigr]\\bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{UniversalTheory}_L(T)\n&\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nT\\subseteq\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2365,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bb6e1781f34c54a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-universal-theory]]；$T\\models\\sigma$ 是 [[17-df-theory-properties]] 的语义后承，均在语言 $L$ 中解释。\n以下定义集合 $T_\\forall$ 与二元谓词 $\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T,U)$。"},{"id":"c6d785e6b3507274","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L$ (universal sentences, see [[17-df-universal-theory]])"},{"id":"2c69f6ba0ceba942","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\operatorname{SubstructurePreservedTheory}_L$ 见 [[17-df-theory-preservation]]；$\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-universal-theory]]；$\\mathrm{Mod}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。所有模型类在同一语言 $L$ 的 ZFC 元语言中比较。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[17-df-elementary-chain]]\n[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]\n[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n